--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Lazy-wave dynamic power cable in a current with a smeared buoyancy section
-- The Gulf of Mexico 80 m lazy-wave cable of lozon_gomex80_power_cable.dat in a 0.5 m/s uniform
-- current in +X. The 50 m buoyant stretch is one uniform section given by its equivalent
-- diameter and net submerged weight per metre (EQUIVALENT BUOYANCY): -80.15 N/m, the uplift of
-- the 0.29 m, 59.53 kg/m buoyancy section. Compare with lazy_wave_buoyancy_modules.dat, which
-- builds the same stretch from ten discrete modules at a 5 m pitch on the same mesh.
